Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:22:26 -0700
Subject: Seal the child header with the ordered transaction root.

Build one TxIdentityPair per transaction with TransactionHash then
TransactionId, commit that sequence with TransactionRoot, and pass the
digest to SealChildHeader. An empty list matches the development genesis
digest. Nonce stays zero. This does not search a nonce or submit the
header to lotusd.
